================================================================================
                              WHAT THIS TOOL DOES
================================================================================

Read Section 7 (Disclaimer of Warranty) and Section 8 (Limitation of Liability)
of the License before running this. They are not boilerplate here.

PinnacleCyPat makes broad, largely irreversible changes to a Windows system. It
deletes local user accounts, resets passwords, disables and reconfigures
services, rewrites registry values and security policy, uninstalls software,
changes firewall rules, and deletes files it judges to be prohibited media.

It is built for disposable competition images. It is NOT built for, and must not
be run on, a machine whose contents matter: a personal computer, a work
computer, a server, or anything you are not prepared to rebuild from scratch.

Use `--dry-run` first. It previews every change and applies none.

